Description: Implement the presentation-time protocol
 Without it a client cannot learn when its frames reach the screen, and
 Chromium paces its frames off a timer that each frame callback re-phases; a
 30 fps video in Brave loses about every eighth frame. The compositor reports
 each frame's presentation time and refresh interval from its master clock.
Author: Aleksey Samoilov <samoilov.lex@gmail.com>
Origin: other, https://github.com/linuxmint/muffin/pull/843
